[{"client_msg_id":"11f04953-ada8-4309-a3f7-0f771a652b61","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"プランナー→プログラマー→社長 の人知ってる","ts":"1627535877.225000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"36v"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5c4c17f4-f7f3-4e2f-9eb5-bcdb92fdd92e","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"プランナーからプログラマーというキャリアもすごいな","ts":"1627535630.224500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Q+FV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"78f75038-e822-4a7e-8d10-716947b33cdd","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"言ってもいくらでも出していいならさすがに集まるんじゃなかろうか (実際にはいくらでもは出せないが)","ts":"1627535187.224000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wUcM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f92c54b7-c1c8-4730-b954-c15cf4a5f51e","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"給料出すだけでデザイナーが集まるなら苦労せんのよな。","ts":"1627535126.223500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Lnf0W"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fbb1cc44-ed62-4d7e-91d7-2a372b8ca27d","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"十把一絡げに言うのはむずかしそうだ\nとりあえずデザイナーにとっての魅力は給料以外であることが多そうだ","ts":"1627535105.223200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JV2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7352c915-3129-4e91-8b0d-0475a5f4520e","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"プログラマーはプログラマーでもゲームプログラマーになると話が変わってきたりするのかもしれない(し、しないのかもしれない。最近はどうなんだろ)","ts":"1627534889.222700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZOqj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9EE6160F-187A-4270-946B-B6C2CCB0442B","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"プログラマー、今だと新卒採用はとりあえず数が多いイメージあるけど。\n新卒採用以外が厳しいのは、どの職種も基本同じで、ただデザイナーとかは新卒採用の枠がそもそも少ないので大学出ても就職先がなかったりする。","ts":"1627534829.221900","edited":{"user":"UFHQ7TNT0","ts":"1627534842.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PM6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"424dbab9-4c78-40b6-8583-9ee22161b499","type":"message","user":"U01HFNMNB55","text":"僕とかなり似てるな","ts":"1627534749.219900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gNq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a6d862b1-569c-40a5-840e-415883a599d7","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"逆にプログラマーだとそうじゃないんですかね？\n自分は大学中退→バイトでプランナー→急にやめて未経験プログラマー\nっていう無茶なことしててまさに薄給でもいいから業界に入りたいって感じだったんですが","ts":"1627534703.219200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"h7j"}]},{"client_msg_id":"68E5DFBA-9E27-4313-A8CB-84DA9575FB38","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"なので、薄給でもとりあえず最初のキャリアを手に入れたいみたいな。","ts":"1627533912.218200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Dlg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"20BB6DD3-A5EE-49D6-BC10-45F2FBAD9694","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"デザイナーは最初に就職するのが大変系かな。","ts":"1627533878.217300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"epo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ec527718-077a-4237-ac71-9976f4d3208d","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"ただプログラマーの方が高すぎて変といえるかもしれない","ts":"1627532992.216600","edited":{"user":"UKHUVMBJR","ts":"1627534656.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ulpb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e04312d1-e61d-4e23-961d-dff1ca51e65b","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"アニメーターとかそうだし実際給与水準そんな高くなさそうな","ts":"1627532968.216200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"23J"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f98ffbd9-8597-40db-b63c-db10f81ec20c","type":"message","user":"UNJ2DANJC","text":"デザイナーってやりがい搾取系なのだろうか","ts":"1627532222.215800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ca8u"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cbef9ffc-ad60-42d5-b6ee-071bfe001a1b","type":"message","user":"UNJ2DANJC","text":"確かにこの件はちがいそうですね。\n応募者に聞いてみたいところ","ts":"1627532146.214100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Z3DS"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"高いかなあ？（これはプログラマーの話なので類推でしかないけど、これよりがっつり高いとも思えない）","ts":"1627532038.212000","attachments":[{"color":"D0D0D0","fallback":"[July 29th, 2021 1:00 PM] thinca: \u003chttp://vanillaware.co.jp/recruit_inside.htm\u003e\n\u0026gt; 初任給月額20万円～25万円以上\nあれ、これ中途採用じゃないの?","author_id":"U03C71D7H","author_name":"thinca","author_subname":"thinca","author_link":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/team/U03C71D7H","author_icon":"https://avatars.slack-edge.com/2015-01-15/3417067010_04a676b32692fb2507e1_48.jpg","text":"\u003chttp://vanillaware.co.jp/recruit_inside.htm\u003e\n\u0026gt; 初任給月額20万円～25万円以上\nあれ、これ中途採用じゃないの?","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"Posted in #life-jobboard","ts":1627531259.209600,"from_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/C01DT9XN3NX/p1627531259209600"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3git0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"66366033-a00d-4a22-b21b-29a38524db8c","type":"message","user":"UNJ2DANJC","text":"（給料が高い）","ts":"1627531939.211900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"k+D"}]},{"client_msg_id":"629fcd08-6da2-4d4b-ad20-4313a7aa50d1","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"デザイナーにとって魅力があるという状態がどういう状態なのか気になる。","ts":"1627531906.211300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"R++"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bc256b3a-0fdd-4710-bd2a-423da1c31d86","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"オタク受けする作品が出る/バズるとデザイナーが来るのかな","ts":"1627531430.211000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"H+7f"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a83a3db8-0529-42ea-95ae-5c4bbe065a6e","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"ああ朧村正","ts":"1627531393.210600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VuYr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8df1dcc7-94d3-4a54-aa35-7465f3cae9d8","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"朧村正はタイトルだけ聞いた事あった","ts":"1627531384.210400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7FstX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5382a81b-fe34-49da-86f2-31ed532257e8","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"十三機兵防衛圏で相当バズりましたね、ほかは知らない","ts":"1627531330.210100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"H9bdc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"85547249-f623-43f2-9b1b-d8db81e940ed","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"この会社のタイトル私全然知らないな…","ts":"1627531307.209900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0Ve"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8e20d8e7-76e6-4edf-b08a-9568cad2ce7a","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"\u003chttp://vanillaware.co.jp/recruit_inside.htm\u003e\n\u0026gt; 初任給月額20万円～25万円以上\nあれ、これ中途採用じゃないの?","ts":"1627531259.209600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1nDe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5eda726f-38ad-4931-9b96-330890f70d75","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/eihigh_re0/status/1420594137598885888\u003e","ts":"1627531089.208900","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/eihigh_re0|@eihigh_re0\u003e: デザイナーが集まりやすいの羨ましい……この偏りの原因は何だろう？　デザイナーの集め方があるなら取り入れてみたい…… \u003chttps://twitter.com/vanillaware_boy/status/1420587437206564864\u003e","id":1,"author_name":"えいち/eihigh","author_subn